# covr exclusion patterns. Matches gitignore-style globs against paths
# relative to the package root. See:
# https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/covr/readme/README.html
#
# imurun is pure R with no Stan-generated C++, so there is nothing to
# exclude from coverage. This file is intentionally near-empty; it exists
# so the exclusion policy is explicit and easy to extend later.
